# Options for the prysm-headless service, read when it starts. The unit runs
#   /usr/bin/prysm-headless /var/lib/prysm/settings.json $OPTIONS
# with the words of OPTIONS as further arguments. Edit this file, then run
# `sudo systemctl restart prysm-headless`. `prysm-headless --help` lists every
# option. An upgrade keeps this file as you edited it.
#
# Examples:
#   start Screen sync when the service starts:
#     OPTIONS="--start"
#   allow the slim TV app, which controls Prysm from the origin `null`:
#     OPTIONS="--allow-origin null"
#   both:
#     OPTIONS="--start --allow-origin null"
OPTIONS=
